  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add onions, finely chopped garlic, and bell peppers. Stir fry until the vegetables are slightly tender.",
    "Stir in massaman curry paste, salt to taste, and tahini sauce.",
    "Pour in chicken broth or water, stir again, bring to a simmer, then cover and let cook for about 10 minutes until thickened.",
    "Add soy sauce (or tamari) just before serving for extra umami flavor."
